{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"34753","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v46094","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"ゆなまろ","creatorId":"vndb:s30628","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:38948","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s30628","name":"ゆなまろ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:269505","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"アカマダラ","creatorId":"vndb:s33935","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:40011","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s33935","name":"アカマダラ","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:269506","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c130505","characterName":"浦上 リリア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"134584","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"448440"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24794"],"vndbCharacterId":"c130505"},"originalCharacterName":"浦上 リリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A talented half-Japanese female lawyer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she takes on cases from the corporate world to the underworld, anything that benefits her - even cases that border on criminality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her character is cold-hearted and ruthless, and she will do anything and everything to get her way."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has her fair share of resentment, of course, but she is more than half-hearted in her lawsuits against those who target her, and uses those in the underworld with whom she is in close contact to silence them."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c130505"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ハーフの敏腕女弁護士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、企業から裏社会に至るまで、利益になれば何でも――それこそ犯罪すれすれの事案でも受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その性格は冷徹冷酷、自分の思い通りにするため、ありとあらゆる手を使う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もちろん相当に恨みを買っているが、自分をつけ狙う者に半ば以上難癖で訴訟すると共に、彼女と懇意にしている裏社会の者たちを使い、その口を封じてきている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24794","sourceWorkId":"34753","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ハーフの敏腕女弁護士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、企業から裏社会に至るまで、利益になれば何でも――それこそ犯罪すれすれの事案でも受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その性格は冷徹冷酷、自分の思い通りにするため、ありとあらゆる手を使う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もちろん相当に恨みを買っているが、自分をつけ狙う者に半ば以上難癖で訴訟すると共に、彼女と懇意にしている裏社会の者たちを使い、その口を封じてきている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"134584"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/ede6c7736e6a81ae2d0c9adda689aea1cd788e386a9b5e31a44938b5092ab002.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7af0f93cabf2ae58fae586c1e445d57258ab32efba149ad27b4c5c79067b012.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤本教子","creatorId":"vndb:s649","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s649","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s649","name":"平野響子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:448440:134584:5669:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c130506","characterName":"久世 あいり","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"134583","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"448440"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24793"],"vndbCharacterId":"c130506"},"originalCharacterName":"久世 あいり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An up-and-coming idol."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her innocent, young appearance, her character is mature in a bad way."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She takes advantage of her good looks and popularity and always tries to be selfish."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She believes that the world revolves around her, so she will never tolerate anyone who is more popular than her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For this reason, she routinely hires people to humiliate prominent idols. Naturally, she has earned a considerable number of grudges, but she is not bothered by this at all。"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c130506"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新進気鋭のアイドル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのあどけなく幼い容貌とは裏腹に、その性格は悪い意味で大人びたもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の容貌と人気をかさに着て、我がままを常に通そうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分を中心に世界が回っていると考えているため、自分よりも人気のある存在は絶対に許せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、人を雇って目立つアイドルを暴行・強姦することは日常茶飯事である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当然ながら相当の数の恨みを買っているが、それもどこ吹く風か、まったく気にしていない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24793","sourceWorkId":"34753","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新進気鋭のアイドル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのあどけなく幼い容貌とは裏腹に、その性格は悪い意味で大人びたもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の容貌と人気をかさに着て、我がままを常に通そうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分を中心に世界が回っていると考えているため、自分よりも人気のある存在は絶対に許せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、人を雇って目立つアイドルを暴行・強姦することは日常茶飯事である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当然ながら相当の数の恨みを買っているが、それもどこ吹く風か、まったく気にしていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"134583"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9e268f9c9b5fdd80d9bfadb3b2245238f56bd9dd85c55548acb20257d53783c0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a9ace071813cc74ce3afc2d6299658a55de8f7cefce19cad26daae1a9e8e7b7.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高村優里","creatorId":"vndb:s354","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s354","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s354","name":"高村 優里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto